S-coherence

# NULL storage refuses: three-valued logic used to let it through the NOT IN check, and the
# trees INSERT (whose text interpolates storage) then compiled to NULL and was filtered out,
# leaving a table, a macro and partitions with no catalog row (I3)
statement error
CALL tree_ddl_create('main', 'bad9', tree_spec(tree_shape("order" := 'node_id', level := 'depth'), source := 'read_parquet(''test/data/app.parquet'')', storage := NULL));
----
storage must be

