----
every PSEUDO needs a name and a body

statement error
CALL tree_ddl_create('main', 'bad16', tree_spec(tree_shape("order" := 'node_id', level := 'depth', semantic := tree_semantic(pseudo := [{name: NULL, body: 'true'}])), source := 'read_parquet(''test/data/app.parquet'')'));
----
every PSEUDO needs a name and a body

